"/zh/docs/docker#找-webui-临时密码","content":"临时密码**只在全新数据卷首次启动时**输出一次。复用旧卷 / 重启都不会重新生成。"},"454":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-133","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#多开-qq多账号","content":"Linux QQ 自带单实例锁：在已有 QQ 跑着的桌面里直接再点一次 QQ 图标，只会把已有窗口聚焦，**起不来第二个进程**。锁文件落在 `$HOME/.config/QQ/SingletonLock`，所以每个实例必须有自己的 `HOME`。"},"455":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-134","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#多开-qq多账号","content":"SnowLuma 一侧不需要任何额外配置：HookManager 会遍历所有 QQ 主进程，新启动一个就自动注入一个，每个 UIN 拉一个独立 `OneBotInstance`，配置存到对应的 `config/onebot_<uin>.json`。"},"456":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-135","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#用-snowluma_extra_qq_homes-声明推荐","content":"把额外的 `HOME` 目录写进变量即可，每个目录会由 supervisord 单独托管一个 QQ 进程——崩溃后**只重启那一个账号**，不会连累其他号："},"457":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-136","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#用-snowluma_extra_qq_homes-声明推荐","content":"路径用逗号或空格分隔。开头的 `/app`（主账号）会被自动跳过，重复路径和相对路径会被忽略并在日志里给出提示。目录不存在时会在启动阶段自动创建。"},"458":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-137","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#用-snowluma_extra_qq_homes-声明推荐","content":"启动后 `docker logs snowluma` 会打印类似："},"459":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-138","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#用-snowluma_extra_qq_homes-声明推荐","content":"每个账号对应一个 `[program:qq-<目录名>]`，可用 `supervisorctl status` 单独查看："},"460":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-139","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#用-snowluma_extra_qq_homes-声明推荐","content":"**别忘了挂卷。** 只声明了 `SNOWLUMA_EXTRA_QQ_HOMES` 而没给对应目录挂卷时，账号能正常登录，但容器重建后登录态会丢。"},"461":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-140","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#手动在-novnc-桌面里启临时用","content":"只想临时开一个号、不写进 compose 时，在 noVNC 桌面终端里："},"462":{"id":"/zh/docs/docker-141","page_id":"/zh/docs/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/docker#手动在-novnc-桌面里启临时用"